.TH "POLYGLOT:ASYNC" 1 "November 2026" "SPP Framework" "SPP Commands Manual"
.SH NAME
polyglot:async \- Execute managed asynchronous polyglot jobs and background queue tasks
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B php spp.php polyglot:async
\fIjob_id\fR | \fIpayload_base64\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B polyglot:async
processes background asynchronous polyglot jobs dispatched via \fBPolyglotBridge::dispatchAsync()\fR
or SPP's native Queue daemon. It updates persistent job states, propagates W3C distributed
tracing headers, captures exit codes, and provides retry execution semantics.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fIjob_id\fR
Unique identifier of the managed job (e.g. \fIpoly_a1b2c3d4e5f6\fR).
.TP
\fIpayload_base64\fR
Backward-compatible base64-encoded JSON execution payload.
.SH UNDER THE HOOD
Reads and writes atomic job manifests in \fIvar/jobs/polyglot/\fR.
Emits OpenTelemetry spans via \fBW3CTraceContext\fR.
Dispatches concrete language execution via \fBProcessRunner\fR or persistent workers.
